  "description": "The bridge server: native device services as HTTP endpoints on your app's own Shiny.Net.HttpServer, added with http.AddAppDeviceBridge() and callable from a web page, a script or another app. Bridges answer callers on this device only by default (any caller in a debug build), and who may call them is an authorization policy you can replace. No MAUI dependency; Shiny.AppDeviceBridge.WebView adds a WebView host with over-the-air updates.",
